BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Arbutus Cloud: Issues booting or rebooting volume-backed in
 stances
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20191114T205100
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20191115T205100
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-360@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:There's currently an issue preventing volume-backed instances 
 from being created\, or existing volume-backed instances from rebooting wi
 th access to their boot volume. Administrators are aware of the issue and 
 working towards resolution. Instance operators are advised against rebooti
 ng volume-backed instances at this time.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/
 view_incident?incident=360
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=360
END:VEVENT
