BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] Fixed - Scheduler problem - Problème d'ordonnanceur
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200102T141700
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200102T182100
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-382@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Update: Scheduler had run into an issue Wednesday at 4:10pm PS
 T and it restarted\, scheduling of jobs continued to operate normally but 
 we safely default to not push new jobs to nodes upon scheduler restart in 
 case of actual load issues or other issues. Scheduling to nodes has been r
 esumed this morning.\nThe job scheduler is misbehaving\, which may impair 
 the ability to start new jobs. We are investigating.\n/ L'ordonnanceur a u
 n problème\, ce qui peut empêcher de démarrer de nouvelles tâches. Nou
 s investiguons actuellement ce qui se passe.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan
 .ca/view_incident?incident=382
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=382
END:VEVENT
