UID:drac-incident-442@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:A human error resulted in the disappearance of some python whe
 els from our stack this evening. This does not affect running jobs\, or jo
 bs that rely on existing virtual environment. It may however affect the cr
 eation of new virtual environments. We are currently restoring the delete 
 python wheels.\nWe apologize for the inconvenience.\n-- Une erreur humaine
  a causé la disparition de certains paquets wheel python de notre environ
 nement logiciel ce soir. Ceci n'affecte pas les tâches en exécution ou l
 es tâches qui utilisent des environnements existants. Cela peut par contr
 e affecter la création de nouveaux environnements virtuels. Nous restauro
 ns présentement les fichiers supprimés.\nNous sommes désolé pour ce co
 ntre-temps.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=442
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=442
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200528T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200529T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-435@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:For maintenance purposes\, Graham's unprotected power will be 
 out for 2 hours starting at 10AM\, Thursday\, May 28. This affects all com
 pute nodes\, but not cloud\, storage\, networking and other infrastructure
 . Login/DTN/Platform nodes will not be affected.\nThe scheduler will only 
 start jobs that are expected to end before the outage\; this means that\, 
 for instance\, a 2-day job submitted on the 27th will be delayed till afte
 r the outage.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=435
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=435
END:VEVENT
