BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] Cedar Cloud Outage\, Sep 9\, 3:00PM-5:00PM Pacific
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20200909T184400
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20200910T164500
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-492@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Update: Cedar Cloud was restored to full operation. There was 
 a delay due to a switch connection issue during the restoration of service
 s that slowed the restarting of VMs. Everything should be operating as usu
 al now. Apologies for the delay.\nCedar Cloud will be inaccessible from 3:
 00PM to 5:00PM (Pacific) while we perform an unexpected upgrade our core s
 witch which connects our cloud storage to our cloud nodes.\nPlease refer t
 o the other Cedar Status for more information:\nhttps://status.computecana
 da.ca/view_incident?incident=491\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_inc
 ident?incident=492
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=492
END:VEVENT
