BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Intermittent Connectivity Issues to raw.githubuserconten
 t.com from Arbutus project networks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20210121T174400
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20210121T181500
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-550@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Resolved: raw.githubusercontent.com is once again available fr
 om Arbutus project networks.\nArbutus administrators have become aware tha
 t the CDN service which provides the raw.githubusercontent.com service fro
 m which many GitHub artifacts are sourced is offering an IP address in DNS
  lookups for that domain which is not available\, and some Arbutus project
  networks are affected by this. Administrators are continuing to investiga
 te\, but this issue is external to Arbutus and will require intervention f
 rom GitHub or its CDN service to remediate. This status message will be up
 dated when more information is available.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca
 /view_incident?incident=550
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=550
END:VEVENT
