SUMMARY:[Cedar] External network outage - Panne du réseau externe
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20210703T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20210703T160000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-619@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Due to a scheduled SFU router maintenance on Saturday\, July 3
 \, 2021\, from 8:00 am – 4:00 pm\, Cedar and Cedar Cloud will loss their
  commodity internet access. The R&E network access will not be affected.\n
 This outage is likely to impact most users as people are usually working f
 rom home/remote location. A workaround is possible by logging in to other 
 Compute Canada sites or campus hosts first\, and then connecting to cedar 
 from these sites.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=
 619
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=619
END:VEVENT
