BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Security update - affects logins and job queueing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20210722T194200
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20210727T133200
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-632@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:In response to a critical security update\, all nodes are bein
 g drained to allow them to be rebooted into a new kernel.\nLogin nodes hav
 e been rebooted\, so you may have noticed disconnection of your SSH sessio
 ns.\nCompute nodes are set to drain (not accept jobs)\, so your jobs may w
 ait in the queue longer. While pending they will indicate "Nodes required 
 for job are DOWN\, DRAINED or reserved for jobs in higher priority partiti
 ons)" as a result of this. As soon as compute nodes drain\, they're being 
 rebooted and can handle new jobs as normal.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.
 ca/view_incident?incident=632
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=632
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Béluga] Mise à jour de sécurité
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20210722T204400
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20210802T155500
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-633@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Dû à une faille de sécurité critique\, les noeuds de tête
  ont été mis à jour et redémarrés au cours de la journée du 22 juill
 et.\nNous drainons présentement les noeuds de calcul afin de les mettre 
 à jour et les redémarrer\, ce qui peut affecter le lancement des tâches
 .\n---\nIn response to a critical security update\, all nodes are being dr
 ained to allow them to be rebooted into a new kernel.\nLogin nodes have be
 en rebooted\, so you may have noticed disconnection of your SSH sessions.\
 nCompute nodes are set to drain (not accept jobs)\, so your jobs may wait 
 in the queue longer.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incide
 nt=633
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=633
END:VEVENT
