BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Arbutus RBD Storage - Partial Unavailability of Some Vol
 umes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20211018T161200
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20211018T215100
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-663@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:UPDATE:\nAll affected PGs have been recovered\, and the RBD st
 orage services is fully available.\n-- A Ceph PG consistency issue is curr
 ently causing some Ceph RBD volumes to delay writes\, which may result in 
 instance filesystems hanging or becoming read-only. Administrators are rec
 overing the affected PGs\, and this status notification will be updated wh
 en the recovery is complete.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_inciden
 t?incident=663
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=663
END:VEVENT
