BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] External network outage - Panne du réseau externe
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20220402T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20220402T070000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-746@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:This is a reminder advisory that the planned activity BCNET Co
 re Network Maintenance in Vancouver is to start on Saturday\, April 2\, 20
 22 at 06:00 AM Pacific Time.\nVancouver – VANTX - CR2.VNCV1 vulnerabilit
 y troubleshooting From: 06:00 PT Saturday\, April 2\, 2022 To: 10:00 PT Sa
 turday\, April 2\, 2022 Reason: BCNET Network Engineers together with Juni
 per Advanced TAC will be troubleshooting an existing vulnerability on the 
 CR2.VNCV1 Core Router at the BCNET Vancouver Exchange\, VANTX.\nNo configu
 ration changes to current connections will be done during this maintenance
 .\nEffects: BCNET performed a similar CR2.VNCV1 emergency maintenance on F
 ebruary 26\, 2022.\nWe expect several 20-minute outages to occur during th
 is maintenance window.\nMembers with a connection to only this router will
  experience downtime for all L2 and L3 services (Transit\, IX and ORAN).\n
 Please reply to [email protected] email if you need additional details to
  assess the risk for your organization.\nContact: Please contact the BCNET
  Operations Center at 604-424-0489 option 3 or [email protected] when net
 work problems are experienced outside of a maintenance window.\nPosted By:
  BCNET Network Management Center 604-424-0489 option 3 [email protected]\
 n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=746
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=746
END:VEVENT
