DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20220803T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20220803T210000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-793@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Utility and campus authorities have requested that Graham redu
 ce power usage during today's expected demand peak\, so between 3 and 8 PM
 \, Graham will not start new jobs.  This will allow processors to go into
  low power mode\, but will not affect any running jobs.  Queued or newly 
 submitted jobs will wait until the incident is over.\n\nhttps://status.all
 iancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=793
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=793
