BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] Completed - Upcoming Planned Outage - Panne
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20230623T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20230624T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-948@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Completed:\n/scratch has been purged and rebuilt.\nUpdates hav
 e been applied to the system\, this also includes an updated Scheduler ver
 sion.\nThanks for your patience.\nCedar will be undergoing planned mainten
 ance as we rebuild the /scratch filesystem and update the cluster.  Any r
 unning jobs\, as of the start time\, will be cancelled\, queued jobs are p
 lanned to remain queued.\n/scratch will be purged completely.  Any files 
 you wish to keep\, MUST be copied/moved off of /scratch prior to this outa
 ge.\nUPCOMING /scratch REBUILD Cedar will be unavailable from June 23rd to
  June 27th. During this maintenance window\, the /scratch filesystem will 
 be completely erased and rebuilt. If you do not copy or back up the files 
 you need to keep before June 23rd\, they will be lost and impossible to re
 cover. Note that copying files can take a long time.\nPlease start as soon
  as possible.\nNote that using the “touch” command to avoid periodic p
 urging of /scratch is considered abuse. It will not prevent this planned p
 urge since the whole filesystem will be erased.\nRECONSTRUCTION PROCHAINE 
 DU /scratch Cedar sera indisponible du 23 au 27 juin. Pendant cette pério
 de\, le système de fichiers /scratch sera reconstruit pour en renforcer l
 a stabilité. Les fichiers que vous voulez conserver doivent être sauvega
 rdés ou copiés ailleurs avant le 23 juin\, faute de quoi il sera impossi
 ble de les récupérer. Puisque les opérations de copie peuvent nécessit
 er beaucoup de temps\, nous vous recommandons d’agir au plus tôt.\nNote
 z que l'utilisation de la commande touch pour éviter la purge périodique
  de l’espace /scratch est considérée comme étant une pratique abusive
  et elle n'empêchera pas la suppression de tout le contenu.\n\nhttps://st
 atus.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=948
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=948
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FRDR-DFDR] FRDR Maintenance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20230624T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20230625T000000
