BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] Scheduler problem - Problème d'ordonnanceur
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20231012T015400
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20231012T021200
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1009@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Resolved - The job scheduler is misbehaving\, which may impair
  the ability to start new jobs. We are investigating.\n/ L'ordonnanceur a 
 un problème\, ce qui peut empêcher de démarrer de nouvelles tâches. No
 us investiguons actuellement ce qui se passe.\nFixed.  See note about som
 e PMIx job failures(only new jobs since around 18:00 PST to 18:25 PST) No 
 other issues were found.\nWe're troubleshooting scheduling issues\, submis
 sions continue to function but Partitions are in a Down state\, so no new 
 jobs will Start.  This is due to a PMIx issue\, some PMIx jobs will have 
 failed as COMPLETED shortly after they started.\n\nhttps://status.alliance
 can.ca/view_incident?incident=1009
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1009
END:VEVENT
