BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20240604T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20240605T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1124@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Fibre work completed at 22:20 PDT On June 4\, 2024\, Cedar Com
 pute\, Cedar Cloud\, and associated services will be undergoing system upg
 rades.\nPlease note that on June 4th from 11:30 to 19:30 PDT\, there will 
 be network fibre work being carried out\, resulting in the unavailability 
 of all Cedar services and network connectivity during this period.\nFollow
 ing the restoration of network connectivity\, Cedar Cloud will come back o
 nline\, but Cedar Compute will remain offline until June 8 as we upgrade t
 he cluster operating system\, various storage systems\, and user-visible s
 ervices from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux 9. This upgrade is in anticipation of t
 he End of Life of the CentOS 7 operating system at the end of June\, 2024.
 \nIf you have any questions or concerns about this please contact [email 
 protected] .\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1124
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1124
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Cedar] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240604T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1122@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:On June 4\, 2024\, Cedar Compute\, Cedar Cloud\, and associate
 d services will be undergoing system upgrades.\nPlease note that on June 4
 th from 11:30 to 19:30 PDT\, there will be network fibre work being carrie
 d out\, resulting in the unavailability of all Cedar services and network 
 connectivity during this period.\nFollowing the restoration of network con
 nectivity\, Cedar Cloud will come back online\, but Cedar Compute will rem
 ain offline until June 8 as we upgrade the cluster operating system\, vari
 ous storage systems\, and user-visible services from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux
  9. This upgrade is in anticipation of the End of Life of the CentOS 7 ope
 rating system at the end of June\, 2024.\nIf you have any questions or con
 cerns about this please contact [email protected] .\n\nhttps://status.all
 iancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1122
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1122
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Scheduled Maintenance Possible Outage: Arbutus - Network
  Switch Updates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T063000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20240605T073000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1128@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:On June 5th 2024\, starting at 06:30AM Pacific time\, network 
 switches contributing to the Arbutus Cloud's infrastructure will receive f
 irmware updates. These updates will require restarting the switches\, prod
 ucing brief periods of unavailability for connected systems.\nMost Arbutus
  Cloud infrastructure is configured redundantly at either the control plan
 e or network fabric layers\, but the switches affected by this set of upda
 tes will affect all compute nodes\, and as a result there will be a disrup
 tion of network traffic to all user VM instances \, expected to last up to
  30 minutes.\nThere may also be a period of degraded API performance as th
 e cloud infrastructure re-balances after the updates.\n\nhttps://status.al
 liancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1128
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1128
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Nextcloud] Scheduled Maintenance for Nextcloud Services
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20240606T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20240607T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1133@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:On June 6\, 2024\, there will be a two-day outage to perform e
 ssential upgrades. This maintenance is intended to upgrade Nextcloud softw
 are\, optimize server configurations\, and implement security patches. The
 se actions are crucial for enhancing the performance\, security\, and reli
 ability of our Nextcloud infrastructure.\nDuring this maintenance\, all Ne
 xtcloud services will be unavailable. This includes access to files\, cale
 ndars\, contacts\, and other collaborative features.\n====\nIl y aura arr
 êt des services Nextcloud du 6 au 8 juin prochain\, afin d'effectuer la m
 ise à jour du logiciel\, l'optimisation des configurations des serveurs e
 t l'installation de nouveaux correctifs pour renforcer la  sécurité. Ce
 s travaux sont importants pour l’amélioration et la fiabilité de notre
  infrastructure Nextcloud.\nAucun des services Nextcloud ne sera disponibl
 e\, incluant l’accès aux fichiers\, aux calendriers\, aux contacts et a
 utres fonctionnalités de collaboration.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/
 view_incident?incident=1133
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1133
END:VEVENT
