DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20240620T200000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1137@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:The power utility has requested that we reduce power usage bet
 ween 4pm and 8pm today.\nThe scheduler has been configured to drain nodes 
 during this time\, so your job may be delayed in starting.  Note that alr
 eady running jobs will not be affected - neither will short jobs which end
  before the event.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident
 =1137
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1137
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Power work affecting Arbutus Cloud - no outage expected
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20240624T230600
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20240716T201500
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1138@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:UVic Data Centre Services is upgrading power in the rows hosti
 ng Arbutus Cloud compute and storage.  Most of these hosts have redundant
  power supplies and those that do not will be moved to temporary power bef
 orehand.  No outage is expected.  This message will be updated and this 
 incident will be marked as complete when the work is done.\n----\nData Cen
 tre Services á l'Université de Victoria travailleront sur l'alimentation
  électrique pour les rangées hébergeant le calcul et le stockage Arbutu
 s Cloud. La plupart de ces hôtes ont de la pouvoir redondante et ceux qui
  n'en ont pas auront de la pouvoir temporaire pour la duration du travail.
  Aucune panne n'est prévue. Ce message sera mis à jour et cet incident s
