DESCRIPTION:Please be advised that Arbutus is experiencing limited equipme
 nt power issues. There is no expected outage\, however the system is runni
 ng at reduced redundancy while the issue is resolved.\nThere is maintenanc
 e scheduled for Saturday\, August 31st\, at 7:30 AM PST to restore power r
 edundancy. No outage is expected during this time\, but we continue to ope
 rate with reduced power redundancy on some equipment until then. The maint
 enance is expected to take 4 hours\, during which the entirety of Arbutus 
 will be without redundant power.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_inc
 ident?incident=1179
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1179
