BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Filesystem problem - Problème de système de fichiers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20241017T153100
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20241104T174200
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1212@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:We've recently identified issues with the file system performa
 nce and stability of our storage servers\, which has caused intermittent d
 elays and hangs. Our team is actively addressing the problem and working t
 oward a solution.\nAs the storage hardware is reaching the end of its life
 cycle\, we are seeing an increase in error rates. This may lead to tempora
 ry disruptions while we transition to a new and more reliable system. We u
 nderstand this can be frustrating\, and we appreciate your patience during
  this time. Our goal is to minimize any impact on your work\, and we’ll 
 keep you updated as we progress with the hardware replacement.\nIf you exp
 erience issues lasting longer than one hour and this outage notice hasn’
 t been updated\, please feel free to submit a support request so we can in
 vestigate promptly.\nThank you for your continued support as we work to im
 prove the system.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=
 1212
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1212
END:VEVENT
