DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20250303T153800
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1282@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:We are currently experiencing an issue with volume storage in 
 Arbutus. Any VMs relying on volumes may be impacted at this time.\n*UPDATE
 * Volume storage availability has been restored\, however read and write l
 atencies will be elevated while the storage cluster recovers.\n\nhttps://s
 tatus.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1282
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1282
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] Arbutus Intermittent issues
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20250307T004500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20250307T215100
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1287@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Update March 7 - 13:45 PM: Service is restored and networks ar
 e available again.\nUpdate March 6 - 21:30 PT: Remediation of the issue is
  under way\, and work is continuing. Some long-running restarts of various
  control plane services are required and will continue over night and into
  tomorrow morning.\nThere are reports of intermittent issues with the dash
 board and instances in Arbutus. We are investigating\n\nhttps://status.all
 iancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1287
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1287
END:VEVENT
