BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[DRAC] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20250629T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20250630T000000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1336@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Update June 29\, 2025:\nGlobus services are now back online. T
 he SFU datacenter continues to experience cooling issues.  While temperat
 ures have remained stable over the weekend\, we are keeping all HPC servic
 es offline \, with the exception of Cedar Cloud \, dCache \, and Globus se
 rvices.\nPlease note that all of the file systems accessible via Globus no
 w use the new storage infrastructure . If you encounter any issues\, pleas
 e do not hesitate to submit a support ticket.\nAccess to login nodes is no
 w available.\nThank you for your patience and understanding.\nUPDATE June 
 28\, 2025 :\nSFU data centre is currently experiencing cooling issues. The
  temperature rose significantly over the past 24 hours. We are keeping all
  HPC services offline except Cedar cloud\, dCache services and Globus to a
 ccess old /project filesystem (readonly).\nUPDATE June 24\, 2025 :\nFilesy
 stem (/home\, /scratch) is being updated by the vendor and is no longer av
 ailable until Friday\, June 27. /project will still be available for reado
 nly.\nUPDATE:\n/scratch and /home are now accessible in read only mode on 
 globus Note:\nIf you need urgent read-only access to the project filesyste
 m you can use globus to access your files. You can find more information a
 bout globus in the wiki here:\nhttps://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Globus#Usi
 ng_Globus go to https://globus.alliancecan.ca login and consent to dialogu
 es go to File Manager select the Collection ' computecanada#cedar-globus '
  provide a full path to your file using either the project name or the num
 eric id of the project you want to access. You can get the numeric id by r
 unning the command 'id' on any alliance login node (if you dont specify a 
 path you might get an error message) Cedar will be unavailable from 2025-0
 6-16 to 2025-06-30. During this time\, you will not be able to log in or r
 un jobs on the cluster. Any jobs that are running at the time of the outag
 e will be terminated and you will need to re-submit them once the cluster 
 is back online.\n======\nCedar ne sera pas disponible  2025-06-16 de 2025
 -06-30. Durant cette période\, les utilisateurs ne pourront pas se connec
 ter ni exécuter des tâches sur Cedar. Toute tâche en cours au moment de
  l’arrêt de service sera arrêtée et devra être soumise à nouveau un
 e fois les travaux terminés.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incide
 nt?incident=1336
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1336
END:VEVENT
