BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Arbutus] CephFS Client Version Restriction
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260109T213700
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260504T190300
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1505@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Arbutus renewal we are requiring CephFS client 
 versions to have capabilities of the Luminous release or newer. We are pre
 -emptively making this change in the current CephFS cluster before migrati
 on guidance later this year. For anyone using the CephFS Fuse driver\, thi
 s should not be an issue. Anyone using the CephFS Kernel driver will want 
 to ensure the Linux kernel version is >=4.14. Given the age of this kernel
  version\, we have only detected a small handful of recent connections usi
 ng this version. We don't anticipate any issues or interruptions.\n\nhttps
 ://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1505
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1505
END:VEVENT
