DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260324T080000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1546@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:The winter cooling tower maintenance for the SciNet data centr
 e will take place on March 24 and 25\, 2026\, starting at 7:00 a.m. on the
  24th. This maintenance requires a shutdown of the compute nodes of all Sc
 iNet systems (Trillium\, OnDemand\, Balam\, S4H\, Teach\, as well as hoste
 d equipment). During this time\, l ogin nodes\, file systems\, and the HPS
 S system will remain available.\nJobs submitted to the scheduler will be h
 eld in the queue until maintenance is complete.\nThe compute nodes are exp
 ected to come online again at some time on March 25th.\n\nhttps://status.a
 lliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1546
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1546
END:VEVENT
