BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Nibi] Operating\, but some operations may be disrupted.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260430T135700
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260430T144800
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1588@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:UNPLANNED
DESCRIPTION:Nibi is online and operating\, but some operations may be disr
 upted.\nSpecifically\, there was an initial\, emergency mitigation of a re
 cent security flaw which involved disabling set-uid features.  This would
  have prevented any user of fusermount (sshfs\, squashfs\, some others)\, 
 and may have affected virtual desktop creation (via OnDemand\, including t
 he Jupyterlab component).\nA final fix for the security issue is in place 
 and we'll be restoring these specific edge cases shortly.\n\nhttps://statu
 s.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1588
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1588
END:VEVENT
