DESCRIPTION:This maintenance window\, related to the Trillium expansion fo
 r Canada’s Sovereign Computing Capacity Strategy for AI\, will be start 
 on July 13\, 2026\, at 7 AM EDT and will last until July 24\, 2026. During
  this time which all *Trillium compute nodes* will be unavailable.  The *
 login nodes*\, storage\, HPSS\, Globus\, Open Ondemand\, as well as the S4
 H\, Balam\, Neptune\, and Teach clusters\, will all remain up\, except for
  brief periods on July 21st when transformer maintenance will take place.\
 nMaintenance updates will be published on https://docs.scinet.utoronto.ca 
 .\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1653
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1653
